<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-17T05:46:37.107Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 05:46:37 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The RSF continues to launch drone and air strikes that kill civilians, including a market in Darfur where over 30 people died and a livestock market in Nyala that killed and injured dozens of women and children, while the SAF blames the RSF for a market bombing in Darfur. The RSF also killed a Red Crescent volunteer in an RSF attack. US officials are pressuring the RSF for a humanitarian truce and the UN is calling for an immediate halt to drone attacks. El Niño has contributed to a humanitarian crisis, killing hundreds of children. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFBqRm1wdkg5eDBqWm5VZTVHUDFoT2FlcUVQckstczd6T2NXT3JCWVRlbnVaYWZ5R2tXOG5kMkdqbEIxcEZhRGpOd0Q3YURzSndX?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPRFVtOU0xNWpYSGEtVi1vY0F2QXUwaXNKNEJwa09QeHc1Z3YwdEhlOVhvclFJNERBRnpTeldwbGJ2TlBkTHZKeHFQa2s2SWliN01ZeURvUEgtTG13aEZoNHg1em5tbXJxTTRYTjJsTUhNZ01HMjZJZlhIalFpUE5QcVJlcjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1JWVFpYVFwLTgxaXR1V2N6ZUNJRnJZLXo3Z2RTZkNpNmR5djVUM2FzRFdGekxkV0Ffa2tCbXhqMFMtQlJCRFhEWEJJWmhaZXRV?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1TTTkyVGppeko1WEFvMmEzamUxWU9rVzBaOEh6MklzRUhjRUVaWkJidHEweHFXTDcyT2dERWt4ZDV6bG9hSVdvVWtrTXpLcVRqZjhBVUVNZ2hqdkct?oc=5&quot;&gt;International Crisis Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOT2s0R2xiMGR2NmphNkVZeWZNYjk1R1lPcmVsTW5SSEFGZkZEUnotS29DdC1UamFhZ18wcl9tYThRMWEtQm8wRHhfR2tZdG5uLWtWM3JfSDAzZVdINWdWeGxWa3FTODBOZWM5Q2dNcXpPMlJFYUdJe